+.. _KVM_SET_MEMORY_ATTRIBUTES:
+
 4.141 KVM_SET_MEMORY_ATTRIBUTES
 -------------------------------
 
@@ -6566,6 +6568,80 @@ KVM_S390_KEYOP_SSKE
   Sets the storage key for the guest address ``guest_addr`` to the key
